[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a>\n                                           (for the driver&#x27;s\nside vent)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a>\n                                           (for the\npassenger side vent)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the vent trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044889.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the vent.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044890.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the vent is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Position the vent and secure it using the\nbolts.</p><p>Position the vent trim and fasten it using\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2429574\">7040A18</a>\n                                           (for the\npassenger side vent)</p><p><a href=\"#/2429579\">7040A30</a>\n                                           (for\nthe driver&#x27;s side vent)</p>"]]